sequenceDiagram
    participant CS as Charging Station (Test System)
    participant CSMS as CSMS (System under Test)

    Note over CS,CSMS: Prerequisite: Test System has TxCtlr.SupportedLimits contains maxTime
    Note over CS,CSMS: Configuration State: N/a<br>Memory State: N/a
    Note over CS,CSMS: Execute Reusable State EnergyTransferStarted

    CS->>CSMS: TransactionEventRequest (eventType = Updated, triggerReason = LimitSet, transactionInfo.transactionLimit.maxTime = 120)
    CSMS-->>CS: TransactionEventResponse
    Note over CSMS: Validation: transactionLimit must be omitted

    Note over CS: The Test System waits for the maxTime transactionLimit to be reached

    CS->>CSMS: TransactionEventRequest (eventType = Ended, triggerReason = TimeLimitReached)
    CSMS-->>CS: TransactionEventResponse
